IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sfa-core`
IMPORT `sfa-periods`

-- Securities and Futures Act 2001 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, SSO informal consolidation
-- "version in force from 29/6/2026 to 20/10/2026" (a rendering, not the official text).
-- Part 13 Division 1 Subdivision (2) -- ss 253 to 256: criminal and civil liability for false or misleading statements, and the defences. LAYER 1: the law, objectively.
--
-- Reading a result (the rule of 2026-10-29): JUST TRUE is yes; JUST FALSE is "the TEXT says no in its own words"; NOTHING is "the text does not say".
-- A caller must never turn NOTHING into FALSE. Every "no" branch carries `-- FALSE-kind (...)`, every "not covered" branch `-- NOTHING-kind (...)`.
-- The persons of s 253(4) and s 254(3) are functions of facts about the person; "controlled by" and "related party" are keel concepts and are INPUTS here (a BOOLEAN the seat computes).
-- The defences of s 255 are delegated defences (the ruling of 2026-11-05, `inputs/ENCODING-GUIDE.md:94`): JUST FALSE reads "this section gives no defence on these facts".
-- A claim of the claimant against each person liable under s 254(1), and the duty of that person, are one jural relation; the NOTES file records it.

-- inert (reason 1), lines 40971-40971: s 253 marginal heading: not operative.
-- inert (reason 1), lines 41162-41162: s 254 marginal heading: not operative.
-- inert (reason 1), lines 41293-41293: s 255 marginal heading: not operative.
-- repealed or blank in this text, lines 41375-41375: s 256: "[Repealed by Act 1 of 2005]".

§ `s 253: criminal liability for false or misleading statements`

-- s 253(1), the facts: the "Where" block. A failed "Where" is the text's no (the periods ruling, rule (b)).
-- src:40973 | 253.—(1) Where an offer of securities or securities‑based
-- src:40974 | derivatives contracts is made in or accompanied by a prospectus or
-- src:40975 | profile statement, or, in the case of an offer referred to in section 280,
-- src:40976 | where a prospectus or profile statement is prepared and issued in
-- src:40977 | relation to the offer, and —
-- src:40982 | (a) a false or misleading statement is contained in —
-- src:40984 | (i) the prospectus or the profile statement; or
-- src:40986 | (ii) any application form for the securities or
-- src:40987 | securities‑based derivatives contracts;
-- src:40989 | (b) there is an omission to state any information required to be
-- src:40990 | included in the prospectus under section 243 or there is an
-- src:40991 | omission to state any information required to be included
-- src:40992 | in the profile statement under section 246, as the case may
-- src:40993 | be; or
-- src:40995 | (c) there is an omission to state a new circumstance that —
-- src:40997 | (i) has arisen since the prospectus or the profile
-- src:40998 | statement was lodged with the Authority; and
-- src:41000 | (ii) would have been required to be included in the
-- src:41001 | prospectus under section 243, or required to be
-- src:41002 | included in the profile statement under section 246
-- src:41003 | (as the case may be) if it had arisen before the
-- src:41004 | prospectus or the profile statement was lodged with
-- src:41005 | the Authority,
@ref s 253(1) (the facts) (src:40973-41005)
GIVEN
    `an offer is made in or accompanied by a prospectus or profile statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts made in, or accompanied by, a prospectus or profile statement?
    `the offer is an offer referred to in section 280` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer an offer referred to in section 280?
    `a prospectus or profile statement is prepared and issued in relation to the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a prospectus or profile statement prepared and issued in relation to the offer?
    `a false or misleading statement is contained in the prospectus, the profile statement or an application form` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a false or misleading statement contained in the prospectus, in the profile statement, or in any application form for the securities or securities-based derivatives contracts?
    `there is an omission to state any information required to be included in the prospectus under section 243 or in the profile statement under section 246` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there an omission to state any information required to be included in the prospectus under section 243, or in the profile statement under section 246, as the case may be?
    `there is an omission to state a new circumstance that has arisen since the prospectus or profile statement was lodged` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there an omission to state a new circumstance that has arisen since the prospectus or the profile statement was lodged with the Authority?
    `the new circumstance would have been required to be included had it arisen before lodgment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the new circumstance have been required to be included in the prospectus under section 243, or in the profile statement under section 246, if it had arisen before the prospectus or the profile statement was lodged with the Authority?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F44 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 253(1) the false or misleading statement or omission is present` MEANS
    IF (`an offer is made in or accompanied by a prospectus or profile statement` OR (`the offer is an offer referred to in section 280` AND `a prospectus or profile statement is prepared and issued in relation to the offer`)) AND (`a false or misleading statement is contained in the prospectus, the profile statement or an application form` OR `there is an omission to state any information required to be included in the prospectus under section 243 or in the profile statement under section 246` OR (`there is an omission to state a new circumstance that has arisen since the prospectus or profile statement was lodged` AND `the new circumstance would have been required to be included had it arisen before lodgment`))
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts is made in or accompanied by a prospectus or profile statement, or, in the case of an offer referred to in section 280, where a prospectus or profile statement is prepared and issued in relation to the offer, and"

-- s 253(2): a deeming. A plain "if": NOTHING when it is unmet (fork F45).
-- src:41018 | (2) For the purposes of subsection (1), a false or misleading
-- src:41019 | statement about a future matter (including the doing of, or the refusal
-- src:41020 | to do, an act) is taken to have been made if a person made the
-- src:41021 | statement without having reasonable grounds for making the
-- src:41022 | statement.
@ref s 253(2) (src:41018-41022)
GIVEN
    `the statement is about a future matter, including the doing of, or the refusal to do, an act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement about a future matter (including the doing of, or the refusal to do, an act)?
    `the person made the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person make the statement?
    `the person had reasonable grounds for making the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person have reasonable grounds for making the statement?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F45 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 253(2) a false or misleading statement about a future matter is taken to have been made` MEANS
    IF `the statement is about a future matter, including the doing of, or the refusal to do, an act` AND `the person made the statement` AND (NOT `the person had reasonable grounds for making the statement`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a false or misleading statement about a future matter (including the doing of, or the refusal to do, an act) is taken to have been made if a person made the statement without having reasonable grounds for making the statement"

-- s 253(3): a safe harbour. Only an answer JUST TRUE counts.
-- src:41024 | (3) A person does not contravene subsection (1) if the false or
-- src:41025 | misleading statement, or the omission to state any information or new
-- src:41030 | circumstance, is not materially adverse from the point of view of the
-- src:41031 | investor.
@ref s 253(3) (src:41024-41031)
GIVEN
    `the false or misleading statement, or the omission, is not materially adverse from the point of view of the investor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the false or misleading statement, or the omission to state any information or new circumstance, not materially adverse from the point of view of the investor?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F46 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 253(3) the person does not contravene subsection (1)` MEANS
    IF `the false or misleading statement, or the omission, is not materially adverse from the point of view of the investor`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A person does not contravene subsection (1) if the false or misleading statement, or the omission to state any information or new circumstance, is not materially adverse from the point of view of the investor"

-- s 253(4): the persons guilty. Each paragraph is a function; the combiner follows (a) to (g).
-- src:41037 | (b) where the person making the offer is an entity —
-- src:41039 | (i) each director or equivalent person of the entity; and
-- src:41041 | (ii) if the entity is also the issuer, each person who is, and
-- src:41042 | who has consented to be, named in the prospectus or
-- src:41043 | profile statement as a proposed director or an
-- src:41044 | equivalent person of the entity;
@ref s 253(4)(b) (src:41037-41044)
GIVEN
    `the person making the offer is an entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person making the offer an entity?
    `the person is a director or an equivalent person of the entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a director or an equivalent person of the entity?
    `the entity is also the issuer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the entity also the issuer?
    `the person is, and has consented to be, named in the prospectus or profile statement as a proposed director or an equivalent person of the entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you, and have you consented to be, named in the prospectus or profile statement as a proposed director or an equivalent person of the entity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F47 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 253(4)(b) the person is a director or proposed director of the entity making the offer` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the person making the offer is an entity`)
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "where the person making the offer is an entity"
        IF `the person is a director or an equivalent person of the entity` OR (`the entity is also the issuer` AND `the person is, and has consented to be, named in the prospectus or profile statement as a proposed director or an equivalent person of the entity`)
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "each director or equivalent person of the entity"

-- src:41046 | (c) where the issuer is controlled by the person making the
-- src:41047 | offer, one or more of the related parties of the person
-- src:41048 | making the offer, or the person making the offer and one or
