@ref s 253(4)(d) (src:41060-41080)
GIVEN
    `the person is an issue manager to the offer who is, and has consented to be, named in the prospectus or profile statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an issue manager to the offer, and are you, and have you consented to be, named in the prospectus or profile statement?
    `the person intentionally or recklessly makes the false or misleading statement or omits to state the information or circumstance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you intentionally or recklessly make the false or misleading statement, or omit to state the information or circumstance?
    `the person knows the statement is false or misleading or that the information or circumstance has been omitted and fails to take appropriate remedial action without delay` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Knowing that the statement is false or misleading, or that the information or circumstance has been omitted, do you fail to take such remedial action as is appropriate in the circumstances without delay?
    `the person is reckless as to whether the statement is false or misleading or whether the information or circumstance has been included` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you reckless as to whether the statement is false or misleading or whether the information or circumstance has been included?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F47 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 253(4)(d) the issue manager is one of the persons guilty` MEANS
    IF `the person is an issue manager to the offer who is, and has consented to be, named in the prospectus or profile statement` AND (`the person intentionally or recklessly makes the false or misleading statement or omits to state the information or circumstance` OR `the person knows the statement is false or misleading or that the information or circumstance has been omitted and fails to take appropriate remedial action without delay` OR `the person is reckless as to whether the statement is false or misleading or whether the information or circumstance has been included`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "an issue manager to the offer of the securities or securities-based derivatives contracts who is, and who has consented to be, named in the prospectus or profile statement, if"

