-- src:41101 | (f) a person named in the prospectus or the profile statement
-- src:41102 | with the person’s consent as having made —
-- src:41104 | (i) the statement that is false or misleading, if the person
-- src:41105 | intentionally or recklessly makes that statement; or
-- src:41107 | (ii) a statement on which the false or misleading
-- src:41108 | statement is based, if the person knows that the
-- src:41109 | second‑mentioned statement is false or misleading
-- src:41110 | and fails to take immediate steps to withdraw the
-- src:41111 | person’s consent,
-- src:41113 | (f) but only in respect of the inclusion of the false or
-- src:41114 | misleading statement; and
@ref s 253(4)(f) (src:41101-41114)
GIVEN
    `the person is named in the prospectus or profile statement with the person's consent as having made the false or misleading statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you named in the prospectus or the profile statement, with your consent, as having made the statement that is false or misleading?
    `the person intentionally or recklessly makes that statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you intentionally or recklessly make that statement?
    `the person is named with the person's consent as having made a statement on which the false or misleading statement is based` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you named, with your consent, as having made a statement on which the false or misleading statement is based?
    `the person knows the second-mentioned statement is false or misleading and fails to take immediate steps to withdraw the person's consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know that the second-mentioned statement is false or misleading, and fail to take immediate steps to withdraw your consent?
    `the liability is in respect of the inclusion of the false or misleading statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the liability charged in respect of the inclusion of the false or misleading statement?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F47 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 253(4)(f) the person named as having made a statement is one of the persons guilty` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the liability is in respect of the inclusion of the false or misleading statement`)
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "but only in respect of the inclusion of the false or misleading statement"
        IF (`the person is named in the prospectus or profile statement with the person's consent as having made the false or misleading statement` AND `the person intentionally or recklessly makes that statement`) OR (`the person is named with the person's consent as having made a statement on which the false or misleading statement is based` AND `the person knows the second-mentioned statement is false or misleading and fails to take immediate steps to withdraw the person's consent`)
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a person named in the prospectus or the profile statement with the person's consent as having made"

