GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F47 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 254(3)(da) the underwriter is one of the persons liable` MEANS
    IF `the person is an underwriter (but not a sub-underwriter) to the offer who is, and has consented to be, named in the prospectus or profile statement`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "an underwriter (but not a sub-underwriter) to the issue or sale of the securities or securities-based derivatives contracts who is, and who has consented to be, named in the prospectus or the profile statement"

-- src:41252 | (e) a person named in the prospectus or the profile statement
-- src:41253 | with the person’s consent as having made a statement —
-- src:41255 | (i) that is included in the prospectus or the profile
-- src:41256 | statement; or
-- src:41258 | (ii) on which a statement made in the prospectus or the
-- src:41259 | profile statement is based,
