@ref s 254(3)(e) (src:41252-41261)
GIVEN
    `the person is named in the prospectus or profile statement with the person's consent as having made a statement included in it or a statement on which a statement in it is based` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you named in the prospectus or the profile statement, with your consent, as having made a statement that is included in it, or on which a statement made in it is based?
    `the liability is in respect of the inclusion of that statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the liability in respect of the inclusion of that statement?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F47 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 254(3)(e) the person named as having made a statement is one of the persons liable` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the liability is in respect of the inclusion of that statement`)
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "but only in respect of the inclusion of that statement"
        IF `the person is named in the prospectus or profile statement with the person's consent as having made a statement included in it or a statement on which a statement in it is based`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a person named in the prospectus or the profile statement with the person's consent as having made a statement"

-- src:41263 | (f) any other person who made the false or misleading
