    `the person made the false or misleading statement or omitted to state the information or circumstance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you make the false or misleading statement, or omit to state the information or circumstance (as the case may be)?
    `the liability is in respect of the inclusion of the statement or the omission` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the liability in respect of the inclusion of the statement or the omission to state the information or circumstance?
