`s 254(3)(f) any other person is one of the persons liable` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the liability is in respect of the inclusion of the statement or the omission`)
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "but only in respect of the inclusion of the statement or the omission to state the information or circumstance"
        IF `the person made the false or misleading statement or omitted to state the information or circumstance`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any other person who made the false or misleading statement or omitted to state the information or circumstance"

-- src:41212 | (3) The persons liable are —
-- src:41214 | (a) the person making the offer;
@ref s 254(3) (the persons) (src:41212-41214)
GIVEN
    `the person is the person making the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the person making the offer?
    `what section 254(3)(b) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 254(3)(b) the person is a director or proposed director of the entity making the offer` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `what section 254(3)(c) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 254(3)(c) the person is the issuer or a director or proposed director of the issuer` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `what section 254(3)(d) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 254(3)(d) the issue manager is one of the persons liable` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `what section 254(3)(da) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 254(3)(da) the underwriter is one of the persons liable` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `what section 254(3)(e) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 254(3)(e) the person named as having made a statement is one of the persons liable` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `what section 254(3)(f) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 254(3)(f) any other person is one of the persons liable` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F48 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 254(3) the person is one of the persons liable` MEANS
    IF `the person is the person making the offer` OR (`what section 254(3)(b) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE) OR (`what section 254(3)(c) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE) OR (`what section 254(3)(d) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE) OR (`what section 254(3)(da) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE) OR (`what section 254(3)(e) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE) OR (`what section 254(3)(f) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "The persons liable are" is a list of seven kinds and not closed with "only"

-- s 254(1), the liability: the persons in subsection (3) are liable to compensate any person who suffers loss or damage as a result. The claim of the claimant against each person is the jural relation (a claim-right and a duty).
-- src:41197 | the persons referred to in subsection (3) are liable to compensate any
-- src:41198 | person who suffers loss or damage as a result of the false or
-- src:41199 | misleading statement in or omission from the prospectus or the
-- src:41200 | profile statement, even if such persons, unless otherwise specified,
-- src:41201 | were not involved in the making of the false or misleading statement
-- src:41202 | or the omission.
@ref s 254(1) (the liability) (src:41197-41202)
GIVEN
    `what section 254(1) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 254(1) the false or misleading statement or omission is present` answer for the prospectus or profile statement? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `what section 254(3) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 254(3) the person is one of the persons liable` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `the claimant suffers loss or damage as a result of the false or misleading statement or omission` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the claimant suffer loss or damage as a result of the false or misleading statement in, or the omission from, the prospectus or the profile statement?
    `what section 255 answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 255 the person has a defence` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F51 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 254(1) the person is liable to compensate the claimant` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (`what section 254(1) answers` EQUALS JUST FALSE)
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts is made in or accompanied by a prospectus or profile statement"
        IF (`what section 255 answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "is not liable under section 254(1), only because of a false or misleading statement"
        IF (`what section 254(1) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE) AND (`what section 254(3) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE) AND `the claimant suffers loss or damage as a result of the false or misleading statement or omission`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        IF (`what section 254(1) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE) AND (`what section 254(3) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "liable to compensate any person who suffers loss or damage as a result of"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the persons referred to in subsection (3) are liable to compensate"

